{"id":359,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Because of this Pokémon’s ability to detect danger, people mistook Absol as a bringer of doom."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Although it’s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Long ago, superstitions were spread about it, saying it brought disaster. This fed a hatred of it, and it was driven deep into the mountains."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom bringer."},{"games":["X","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that has a life-span of 100 years."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."},{"name":"Justified","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon is hit by a Dark-type attack, its Attack stat is boosted by its sense of justice."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"White","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":359,"name":"Absol","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,43],[1,98],[5,104],[10,282],[15,197],[20,269],[25,163],[30,400],[35,116],[40,389],[45,14],[50,248],[55,195]],"machine":[403,372,213,226,59,34,340,693,347,370,399,203,263,206,126,53,116,492,248,416,258,506,63,58,196,231,224,371,583,182,427,240,156,514,157,317,496,201,247,421,214,555,173,444,164,241,276,129,14,269,168,675,87,86,85,261,404,428],"egg":[44,174,38,364,277,212],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-180","name":"Mega Absol ex","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"180","artist":null,"img":"me1/180"},{"id":"me2-63","name":"Absol","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Common","number":"63","artist":"Takumi Wada","img":"me2/63"},{"id":"me1-86","name":"Mega Absol ex","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"86","artist":null,"img":"me1/86"},{"id":"me1-161","name":"Mega Absol ex","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"161","artist